Design & Specs: Clad in metallic royal blue, champagne gold, and silver, the suit features a lightweight, form-fitting ergonomic design optimized for extreme speed and agility rather than raw heavy armor.

Tactical Arsenal: Its signature offensive tech is a back-mounted flight pack that opens up to deploy 6 Autonomous Energy Displacers (floating repulsor pods). These pods levitate around Pepper to project powerful offensive energy beams or form multi-angle protective forcefields.

MCU Appearance: Discovered early in Avengers: Endgame when Morgan Stark plays with its helmet in the garage ("a anniversary gift for Mom"), Pepper suits up in Mark XLIX during the final battle against Thanos's forces at the Avengers Compound—fighting side-by-side with Tony, Rhodey, and the rest of the team in a iconic back-to-back repulsor blast combo.
